# Line endings are not cosmetic here. A shell script checked out with CRLF fails
# on Linux with "bash: \r: command not found", which points at nothing, and the
# firmware and SQL are read by tools that are equally unforgiving.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
